    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyalūba ya kūja kū bading'wa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mihayo īyī īfumile mu nyalūba īyo ng'hangi Yelemia akītūma kūfuma Yelusalemu kū banamhala abo baalī bashiigīīla ū mu banhū abo baalī bading'wa, na bagabīji na a bahangi; pye na a banhū a bangī abo Nebukadineza walī wabīnja Yelusalemu ūbatwala Babuloni būkikala kwenūko mu būding'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Ahenaho ū ntemi Yekonia nū nina ū ngole numho basaamiwe ī Yelusalemu, balī mu būding'wa; hamò na a bataale ba ng'wikūlū, na batongeeji ba Yuda, na ba nzengo gwa Yelusalemu, būyaga na baselemala na basuji ba chūma.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī nyalūba yenīyī akabinha ba Elasa ng'wana Shafani, na Gemalia ng'wana Hilikia, abo Sedekia ntemi wa Yuda akabatūma kūja Babuloni, kūlī ntemi Nebukadineza. Ī nyalūba yalī īhayile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA wa mabità, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli, alībawīla pye a banhū abo wabīnja Yelusalemu ūbatwala Babuloni mu būding'wa; alīhaya gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zengagi numba mupandīke wikalo mulembeele; nī migūnda līmagi muyūhamba ng'walya īsho shiligela mo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū gwa liitoola gwītagi dūhū, mubyale baana bagosha na bakīma; na a bitūnja bing'we batoojagi, a bashīke bing'we nabo balekagi bayūtolwa; nabo babyale baana bagosha na bakīma, iyongejagi ko ū kwenūko, mutizūgeha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama nū nzengo gwenūyo ūko naamusaamīja gūkoobelagi mhola na kwīlūkīlwa; ng'ūgūlombela ū kūlī SEEBA, nguno ū goi ūlū gwīlūkīlwa mbango, nū bing'we hū ng'wīlūkīlagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'īyo, ū SEEBA wa mabità ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli, alīhaya gīkī, “Yaya ū kūbazunīlīja bikale būmulembagūla a bahangi bing'we, na a bachembi ba ngoko, abo balī hamò ning'we. Oyagi nū kwikala ng'ūdegeleka ī shiloti shabo īsho mukabahimbīlījaga bikale bakūlootaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakūmuhangīlaga mihayo ya būlomolomo mu lina lyane; ū nene natabatūmile.” Alīhaya SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA alīhaya gīkī, “Ūlū yūkwīndanha ī myaka makūmi mpungatī ī ya Babuloni, nakwiza namushikīlīgīje ū kwisagīja kwane kūlw'ilagane lyane lya shigongo; nakūng'wenha hangī ū kwipandī īlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno nagamanile a maganiko ayo nakang'wganikīlaga a bing'we,” alīhaya SEEBA, “maganiko ga kūng'wītīla misoga, gatī ga kūmuminya yaya; maganiko ga kūmutūūla mu kwisagīlwa kwawiza kūlwa mihayo ya kū būtongi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna mukūyūnitana, ng'wiza nū kūnilomba; nane nakūmudīīlīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangī mukūnikooba munipandīke, shitange munikoobe na ng'holò īmò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūzunya munipandīke.” Alīhaya SEEBA, “Nīyo nakūng'wenha kūfuma ū kū būding'wa wing'we. Nakūmubilinga kwīngīīla kū mahanga a gose, na a mapandī pye a gose ūko naamuponya.” Alīhaya SEEBA. “Nakūng'wenha hangī ū kwipandī īlo nakang'wīnja nūmutwala mu būding'wa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mushikile kūhaya, “Ū SEEBA watwinhile bahangi ū kūūnū Babuloni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alīyo ū SEEBA alī na mhayo gwa kūhaya kūlwa ntemi ūyo igasīgije isumbī lya būtemi lya ng'wa Daūdi, na a banhū abo basaagīīlile ū mu nzengo ūyū, a badūgū bing'we abo batajile hamò ning'we ū mu būding'wa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū SEEBA wa mabità, alīhaya gīkī, “Nakūbatūmīla līlūshū, nzala na mahūūya; nakūbīīta babize gītī tiini jabūbi ījo jitūdūla kūliwa kūlwa nguno mbi no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūbakūūbīlīja bo līlūshū na nzala, na mahūūya; hangī nakūbīīta babize na saalaala ū kū mabūtemi ga mu sī pye a gose, na shikolo sh'izumo n'igekemaja, na sha kūdalahwa na kwibengelejiwa ū mu mahanga a gose ūko nakūbasambaagīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūlwa nguno ya kūlema kwīdima ī mihayo yane.” Alīhaya SEEBA, “Mihayo īyo nikalaga nūbatūmīla ng'hangala na ng'hangala mu nzīla ya batūmami bane, a bahangi. Na a bing'we abo mulī mu būding'wa h'ū gūmò dūhū; mulemile ū kūdegeleka, alīhaya SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, gwigwagi ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA bing'we bose abo akamusaamya kūfuma Yelusalemu ūmutwala Babuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mihayo ya ba Ahabu, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Kolaya, na Sedekia ng'witūnja o ng'wa Maaseya, abo bakūmuhangīlaga būlomolomo mu lina lyane, ū SEEBA wa mabità, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli, alīhaya gīkī, ‘A benabo nakūbatūūla mu makono ga ng'wa Nebukadineza ntemi wa Babuloni, ababūlage mulolile na miso ging'we.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūlwa nguno yabo a benaba, pye a banhū ba kūfuma Yuda abo balī mu būding'wa, bakūyūbazuma a banhū bo kūtūmamīla lūsumo lūhayile gīkī, ‘Ū SEEBA akwītīle gīt'ūmo akabīītīla ba Sedekia na Ahabu, abo ntemi wa Babuloni akabapemba mu moto.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno bīīta mihayo y'ipelanya no ū mu Isilaeli, bashihyaga na bake ba bazenganwa bichabo; hama hangī ī haha bakūyombaga mihayo ya būlomolomo mu lina lyane, mhayo ūyo natabalagīlile kūgwīta. Ī yenīyī nīmanile no ū nene, nalī nkaanīji wayo.” Alīhaya SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mhayo gwa kūtwalīlwa Shemaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Shemaya ūyo wafuma Nehelamu ng'wīlagi gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū SEEBA wa mabità, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli, alīhaya, ‘Ū bebe wabatūmīlile nyalūba pye a banhū ba Yelusalemu mu lina lyako bebe ng'wenekīlī; ūntūmīla nū Sefania ū ng'witūnja wa ngabīji Maaseya, na a bagabīji a bangī pye a bose.’ Ū Sefania wang'wīlile gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Ū SEEBA wakwītile ū bebe kūbiza ngabīji ntaale ha ng'wanya go ng'wa Yehoyada, ūbize ntaale wa numba ya ng'wa SEEBA; ūlī na būdūla bo kūndima nsaji ose ose, ūyo akwishatyaga mu nīmo go būhangi, ūntuga nhendele ūmponya mu jeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama nibūlī lūūlū ūtūng'hamaga ū Yelemia ū muna Anasosi, ūyo akwigīmbaga gīkī ng'hangi wing'we? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bise watūtūmīlile mhayo ū kūnū Babuloni, alītūwīla angū gīkī, Ī likanza līkūlīha, hūna lūūlū zengagi numba mupandīke wikalo mulembeele; nī migūnda līmagi muyūhamba ng'walya īsho shiligela mo.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngabīji Sefania akīsoma ī nyalūba yenīyo kū būtongi bo ng'hangi Yelemia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gwiza ū kūlī Yelemia, gūlīhaya: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū abo balī mu būding'wa pye a bose batūmīlage gūūyū mhayo, Ū SEEBA alīng'wīla ū Shemaya ū muna Nehelamu gīkī, Kūlwa nguno ū Shemaya akūmuhangīlaga a bing'we alīyo natantūmile ū nene, nose akūng'wenhelejaga kūsanya mihayo ya būlomolomo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA alīhaya gīkī, Shiniigelile nang'winhe nsango ū Shemaya ū muna Nehelamu; ū wei ng'wenekīlī nū būbyīle bokwe. Ū mu banhū benaba atūlekeelelwa munhū wakwe nūūlū ūmò, nī yawiza īyo nakūbīītīla a banhū bane atībona na hado yaya, alīhaya SEEBA, kūlwa nguno akūlomeelaga mihayo ya kūnigomela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
